' ─────────────────────────────────────────
'  NOTES
' ─────────────────────────────────────────
note right of CSV
  Known issues handled:
  ✗ product_description — 100% NULL → dropped
  ✗ product_image — URLs only → dropped
  ✗ order_item_id — 1 duplicate → removed
  ✗ latitude/longitude — float variation
    caused fan trap in dim_geography → fixed
    by GROUP BY join key columns only
end note

note right of DCUST
  No SCD2 in this version.
  One row per customer using
  ROW_NUMBER() OVER
  (PARTITION BY customer_id
   ORDER BY order_date DESC)
  Most recent record wins.
end note

note right of DGEO
  Join key: order_city +
  order_country + order_region ONLY.
  MIN(order_state), MIN(market),
  AVG(lat/lon) to avoid fan trap.
  Critical fix discovered during
  diagnosis — float precision caused
  689x row multiplication.
end note

note bottom of FACT
  Grain: one row per order line item (order_item_id)
  ~180,518 rows · 20 columns
  INNER JOIN on customer + product (must match)
  LEFT JOIN on geography + shipping (nullable)
  ON CONFLICT (order_item_id) DO NOTHING as safety net
end note

note right of M1
  REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW
  after every pipeline run
end note

@enduml
